WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.400
Like, so weird that I was trying...
Daddy,

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:04.800
how come you never smile after you say
something funny?

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.800
And it was like, you know, just like,
kind of like, well,

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:08.900
because if you smile, then you know it's
a joke.

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:11.000
But if you, you know, don't smile, then
it's kind of dry.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.100
And that's like sarcasm. And it was
like,

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:15.150
so weird that I was trying to formulate

00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:17.200
what the answer would be to that. But
like,

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:19.200
you don't know what the answer is to
that. It's just like,

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:21.500
your kids have never seen you smile.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:24.767
[Laughter] Think about that. Yeah,
that's what it is.
